      "description": "总览页顶部的品牌大色块：总市值、三项指标与待更新提示。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hero\"><div class=\"ds-hero-top\"><span class=\"ds-hero-label\">总市值</span><span class=\"ds-hero-pill\">2 项待更新</span><span class=\"ds-hero-check\"><i></i>含现金</span></div><div class=\"ds-hero-value\">¥128,460.00</div><div class=\"ds-hero-metrics\"><div class=\"ds-metric\"><span>总投入</span><strong>¥110,200.00</strong></div><div class=\"ds-metric\"><span>累计收益</span><strong>+¥18,260.00</strong></div><div class=\"ds-metric\"><span>收益率</span><strong>+16.57%</strong></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hero{font-family:system-ui,'Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;padding:22px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4A5CF5 0%,#5D60F3 100%);color:#FCFDFF;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(74,92,245,0.25);}.ds-hero-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}.ds-hero-label{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.3px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);}.ds-hero-pill{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);color:#fff;}.ds-hero-check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);}.ds-hero-check i{width:12px;height:12px;border:1.4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);border-radius:3px;}.ds-hero-value{margin-top:8px;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.5px;line-height:1.2;}.ds-hero-metrics{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:24px;}.ds-metric{flex:1;min-width:0;}.ds-metric span{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);}.ds-metric strong{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}"
